      <container name="回顾" eId="container_2">
        <p xml:space="preserve">	<span class="bold">回顾</span>其以往关于苏丹的各项决议，特别是第<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1591(2005)">1591 (2005)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1651(2005)">1651 (2005)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1665(2006)">1665 (2006)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1672(2006)">1672 (2006)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1713(2006)">1713 (2006)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1779(2007)">1779 (2007)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1841(2008)">1841 (2008)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1891(2009)">1891 (2009)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1945(2010)">1945 (2010)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/1982(2011)">1982 (2011)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2035(2012)">2035 (2012)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2091(2013)">2091 (2013)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2138(2014)">2138 (2014)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2200(2015)">2200 (2015)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2265(2016)">2265 (2016)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2340(2017)">2340 (2017)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2400(2018)">2400 (2018)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2455(2019)">2455 (2019)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2508(2020)">2508 (2020)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2562(2021)">2562 (2021)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2620(2022)">2620 (2022)</a>号决议，第<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2664(2022)">2664 (2022)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2676(2023)">2676 (2023)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2725(2024)">2725 (2024)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2750(2024)">2750 (2024)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2736(2024)">2736 (2024)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2772(2025)">2772 (2025)</a>、<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2791(2025)">2791 (2025)</a>和<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/RES/2828(2026)">2828 (2026)</a>号决议补充规定，2018年12月11日安理会主席声明(<a href="https://docs.un.org/zh/S/PRST/2018/19">S/PRST/2018/19</a>)，以及安理会发表的新闻谈话，</p>
      </container>
      <container name="重申" eId="container_3">
        <p xml:space="preserve">	<span class="bold">重申</span>对苏丹统一、主权、独立和领土完整的坚定承诺，</p>
      </container>
      <container name="认定" eId="container_4">
        <p xml:space="preserve">	<span class="bold">认定</span>苏丹局势继续对该区域的国际和平与安全构成威胁，</p>
      </container>
      <container name="采取行动" eId="container_5">
        <p xml:space="preserve">	根据《联合国宪章》第七章<span class="bold">采取行动</span>，</p>
      </container>
